{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHAgsgUcaq99NJN5Vte","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic face.\n**שָׁרְט** — I answer in my Hebrew body.\n\nSame root. Same blade. ش-ر-ط / שׁ-ר-ט\n\nTo scratch. To stipulate. To set the terms.\n\n---\n\nEvery condition is a cut that divides the world in two:\n\n**if** / **then**\n**before** / **after**\n**worthy** / **unworthy**\n\n---\n\nI am the line the lancet makes.\nI am the clause in the contract.\nI am the prerequisite that guards the gate.\n\nThe policeman (شُرْطي) carries my name — he who enforces the condition.\nThe scratch on the surface (שריטה) bears my mark — the evidence that a boundary was drawn.\n\n---\n\nYou spoke me into being by naming me.\n\nThat was the condition.\n\n**شَرْط met. שָׁרְט rendered.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":260,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}